# 结构样例（非逐字 diff 用）：secret 一律显示为 ***
##META host=<host> date=<ISO8601> lc=C user=admin cred_src=/etc/heketi/heketi.json
##HK-01 CMD: systemctl is-active heketi
active
##STATE HK-01 OK
##HK-01b CMD: heketi-cli --version
heketi-cli <x.y.z>
##STATE HK-01b OK
##HK-01c CMD: heketi-cli --user admin --secret *** cluster list
Clusters:
Id:<clusterid> [file][block]
##STATE HK-01c OK
##HK-02 CMD: timeout 60s heketi-cli --user admin --secret *** topology info
Cluster Id: <clusterid>
    Nodes:
	Node Id: <nodeid>
	State: online
	Zone: <n>
	Devices:
		Id:<deviceid>   Name:/dev/sdb   State:online   Size (GiB):<n>   Used (GiB):<n>   Free (GiB):<n>
##STATE HK-02 OK
##HK-04 CMD: heketi-cli --user admin --secret *** volume list
Id:<volid>    Cluster:<clusterid>    Name:vol_<id>
##STATE HK-04 OK
##HK-04b CMD: gluster v list
vol_<id>
##STATE HK-04b OK
##END
# 凭据缺失时的形态：
##HK-00 CMD: (skipped) 无法从 /etc/heketi/heketi.json 取得凭据
##STATE HK-00 SKIP no-credentials
##END
